1
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:35,070
♪A beam of light penetrates
through the dust♪

2
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:37,950
♪Through meridians, bright and dim♪

3
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:41,230
♪Tearing apart the gloom♪

4
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:43,910
♪Unbreakable threads of love♪

5
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:46,790
♪Bewilder the mind♪

6
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:50,510
♪Brushing off the snow with a turn♪

7
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:52,670
♪Who approaches?♪

8
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:56,390
♪Unable to resist the stormy burial♪

9
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:59,190
♪Bound and entangled,
the line between black and white blurs♪

10
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:02,150
♪The skeletal remains
beneath my feet lowly roar♪

11
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:05,470
♪Saying we aren't born with power♪

12
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:07,990
♪Staining the vast sky
with blood to ignite♪

13
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,310
♪A rebellious battle♪

14
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:13,830
♪Awaiting the rebirth
of a slumbering heart♪

15
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:16,950
♪Phoenix-like♪

16
00:01:17,520 --> 00:01:19,630
♪Until the boundless firmament♪

17
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:22,270
♪Fills it for me♪

18
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:24,910
♪In every corner of heaven and earth♪

19
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:27,750
♪Mountains, rivers, seas and more♪

20
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:31,790
♪I reign supreme♪

21
00:01:36,260 --> 00:01:41,740
[The Proud Emperor of Eternity S1 (Pt 1)]

22
00:01:41,820 --> 00:01:44,100
[Episode 1]

23
00:02:08,660 --> 00:02:10,500
[Purple Scale Beast]

24
00:03:19,020 --> 00:03:21,460
[Liu Fei, store owner]

25
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:32,440
You struck gold once more.

26
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:36,400
Thanks.

27
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:47,600
If you're tired,

28
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:50,600
you can take a break in a room here.

29
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:00,680
Interesting.

30
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:05,440
You can't slip from my grasp.

31
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:10,560
Is Ms. Liu sweet on this guy now?

32
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:13,000
This is the renowned Fierce!

33
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,120
Fierce?

34
00:04:14,320 --> 00:04:15,580
(He's now)

35
00:04:15,580 --> 00:04:17,160
(a master who has made it
onto the Tian Ranking,)

36
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:21,000
(referred to as Fierce
by the martial world.)

37
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:29,280
After all this time,

38
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:30,080
do you...

39
00:04:30,080 --> 00:04:30,600
[Lin Rou, the eldest daughter
of the Lin family]

40
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:31,200
do you...

41
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:33,720
still not get
that I have feelings for you?

42
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,560
You already have a fiance.

43
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:39,640
Fiance?

44
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:43,960
That guy's destined to be just a nobody.

45
00:04:45,080 --> 00:04:45,720
I have...

46
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:47,160
no interest in him.

47
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:49,520
He's a total loser who can't cultivate,

48
00:04:50,280 --> 00:04:51,800
so of course you have no interest in him.

49
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:54,680
But unfortunately,

50
00:04:55,320 --> 00:04:56,480
Ms. Lin,

51
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:58,520
I also have no interest in you.

52
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:06,680
No one has ever dared
to treat me this way!

53
00:05:15,540 --> 00:05:18,020
[Chu Kuangsheng, the eldest son
of the Chu family]

54
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,960
Chu Qing, you're being too much!

55
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:27,560
I think it's a good suggestion.

56
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:29,080
Liu'er, why get so bent out of shape?

57
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:30,200
Shameless! You...

58
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:31,000
[Chu Liu'er, the eldest daughter
of the Chu family]

59
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:33,080
[Yun, a maid in the Chu Mansion]
Mr. Chu, you're finally back!

60
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:35,400
Liu'er, what's going on?

61
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:38,160
It's nothing.

62
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:39,560
Don't worry.

63
00:05:42,660 --> 00:05:44,940
[Chu Qing, a disciple of the Chu family]

64
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:49,600
What brings you here, Mr. Chu Qing,

65
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:51,680
the talent of the Chu family?

66
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:54,920
You're just in time.

67
00:05:55,840 --> 00:05:59,440
I'm going to marry your elder sister
as per the Grand Elder's order.

68
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:00,360
Marry?

69
00:06:01,320 --> 00:06:03,200
You're reaching for the moon!

70
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:04,920
In your dreams!

71
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,280
Don't act rashly.

72
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:11,320
Chu Qing is the Grand Elder's godson.
A bright future awaits him.

73
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:14,720
Once they get married,
you become a family.

74
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:16,780
This way,

75
00:06:16,780 --> 00:06:19,080
you can peacefully live out
the rest of your life.

76
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:23,160
You can't even cultivate.

77
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:25,560
How are you supposed
to protect your sister?

78
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:27,560
Getting her to marry Chu Qing

79
00:06:28,200 --> 00:06:29,400
is the best bet.

80
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:33,400
Ms. Lin, you're super gifted.
I naturally can't compare

81
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:34,800
as an average person.

82
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:38,640
At least you have a hint
of self-awareness.

83
00:06:39,080 --> 00:06:41,480
Our engagement is bound
to be called off sooner or later.

84
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:45,840
Without me having you under my wing,
you won't last a day in the Chu Mansion.

85
00:06:47,400 --> 00:06:48,400
Under your wing?

86
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:51,120
Ms. Lin, you must be kidding.

87
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:52,800
Don't think

88
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:56,480
that I, Chu Kuangsheng,
care about our engagement.

89
00:06:56,840 --> 00:06:57,880
That'd be the best.

90
00:06:58,680 --> 00:07:01,640
Seems like you have a good sense of tact.

91
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:04,700
Any gripes
about me marrying your sister...

92
00:07:04,700 --> 00:07:05,720
then?

93
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:09,560
Stop it! I'm down with your...

94
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:10,040
Liu'er,

95
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:11,400
we can't!

96
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:28,860
[Challenge letter]
This is my challenge letter to you,

97
00:07:28,860 --> 00:07:30,480
the top talent of the Chu family.

98
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,200
Are you challenging me to a duel?

99
00:07:32,760 --> 00:07:35,720
Three months down the line,
you and I will have a duel.

100
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:37,360
If I go down,

101
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:39,160
you can do whatever you want with me.

102
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:40,840
But if you bite the dust,

103
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:43,480
the engagement between you
and my sister is off.

104
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:46,520
And you never set foot in this mansion!

105
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:51,280
You're on!

106
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:03,400
Once your sister gets married,

107
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:06,200
I will arrange a shop for you

108
00:08:06,880 --> 00:08:08,360
so that you can peacefully spend
the rest of your life.

109
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:13,520
Well, then... Ms. Lin, thanks a bunch.

110
00:08:14,280 --> 00:08:17,240
It's no big deal to me.

111
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:22,720
You shouldn't have challenged
Chu Qing to a duel.

112
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:27,080
Liu'er, no worries.

113
00:08:27,840 --> 00:08:30,280
In three months, I'll show them

114
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:31,720
that we siblings

115
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:33,600
are not ones to be messed with.

116
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:36,200
I believe in Mr. Chu!

117
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:40,080
(Something seems different
about Kuangsheng.)

118
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:45,480
Liu'er!

119
00:08:48,280 --> 00:08:49,000
Ms. Chu!

120
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:05,040
Go get some medicine
to alleviate Liu'er's condition.

121
00:09:05,880 --> 00:09:06,680
I'm going to gather herbs
in the mountains.

122
00:09:10,680 --> 00:09:12,680
Where did Kuangsheng come
up with all this money?

123
00:09:19,560 --> 00:09:22,360
There are many spiritual herbs growing
on this mountain,

124
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:25,800
but ordinary people can't recognize them.

125
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,400
Finally, got them all.

126
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:47,520
Pity that these herbs can only alleviate
Liu'er's pain temporarily.

127
00:09:47,520 --> 00:09:49,160
They can't fix it for good.

128
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:05,000
Who's there? Show yourself!

129
00:10:07,640 --> 00:10:10,640
Never thought a loser
like you'd have the guts

130
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:14,000
[Chu Yan, a disciple of the Chu family]
to challenge my brother.

131
00:10:14,800 --> 00:10:16,120
(Chu Yan, that pig!)

132
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:20,280
(He harassed Ms. Qiu publicly a year ago,)

133
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:22,520
(nearly causing a disaster
for the Chu family.)

134
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:24,780
(If it weren't
for Chu Qing's intervention,)

135
00:10:24,780 --> 00:10:26,160
(he'd have been expelled
from the Chu family long ago.)

136
00:10:28,280 --> 00:10:30,400
You guys came here just to say this?

137
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:36,380
Give me those herbs,

138
00:10:36,380 --> 00:10:39,280
or I won't pull any punches with you.

139
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:45,320
Then it's all yours.

140
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:58,680
There I was thinking this guy
had toughened up with time.

141
00:10:58,800 --> 00:11:01,400
Turns out he's still a wimp.

142
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:04,880
Destined to be a loser.

143
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:11,720
You think you can just
walk away like that?

144
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:18,520
Three months later,
after he teaches that loser a lesson,

145
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:22,040
Senior Chu Qing can finally bring
the beauty home.

146
00:11:23,920 --> 00:11:28,640
You bet. As for those girls
form the Ya Pavilion...

147
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:30,940
Our turf.

148
00:11:30,940 --> 00:11:33,560
If you enjoy it, take your sweet time.

149
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:36,540
What's got you so happy?

150
00:11:36,540 --> 00:11:38,280
Spill it. Let's all have
a good laugh together.

151
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:53,600
Who... Who are you? What do you want?

152
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:58,720
I've been feeling the urge lately.
Looking for someone to spar with.

153
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:00,620
- Fierce?
- Fierce?

154
00:12:00,620 --> 00:12:01,220
Fierce?

155
00:12:01,880 --> 00:12:03,020
I don't buy

156
00:12:03,020 --> 00:12:04,840
that he alone can make any waves.

157
00:12:05,440 --> 00:12:06,080
Gang up on him!

158
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:40,520
How formidable!

159
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:03,880
Hand over everything

160
00:13:04,800 --> 00:13:05,600
you've got.

161
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:08,800
Fierce, don't go too far.

162
00:13:12,040 --> 00:13:13,120
What a load of rubbish.

163
00:13:26,480 --> 00:13:28,880
Thank you for the gift,
then I'll gladly accept it.

164
00:14:23,020 --> 00:14:23,860
Are you tailing me?

165
00:14:26,860 --> 00:14:28,620
How can you call it tailing?

166
00:14:28,620 --> 00:14:31,420
I just happened to pass by here.

167
00:14:31,820 --> 00:14:34,980
I never thought that the renowned Fierce

168
00:14:35,460 --> 00:14:37,260
would actually be the useless young master
of the Chu family.

169
00:14:38,460 --> 00:14:39,140
You saw it all?

170
00:14:41,900 --> 00:14:44,460
Would you believe me
if I say I didn't see anything?

171
00:14:47,100 --> 00:14:49,420
Are you planning to kill me, Mr. Chu?

172
00:14:49,420 --> 00:14:51,100
Can you really bring yourself to do it?

173
00:15:00,180 --> 00:15:02,340
I'm not one of the righteous.

174
00:15:02,340 --> 00:15:03,820
Don't try to seduce me.

175
00:15:06,300 --> 00:15:06,780
Swallow this.

176
00:15:08,060 --> 00:15:08,700
What's that?

177
00:15:09,220 --> 00:15:11,700
Poison. Only I have the antidote.

178
00:15:13,780 --> 00:15:15,020
What if I don't swallow it?

179
00:15:27,180 --> 00:15:30,700
Just you wait, you scoundrel!
Sooner or later, you'll be sorry.

180
00:15:40,620 --> 00:15:40,980
Oh no!

181
00:15:58,660 --> 00:16:03,220
[Advertisement]